              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "op-pg": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 1043,
          "title": "Agent host containers",
          "description": "Postgres, the PDC agent and the developer containers, as the host Alloy ships them. Expand a line for its container label.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\", service_name=\"${svc_agent_host}\"}",
                        "legendFormat": "",
                        "queryType": "range",
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "logs",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "showTime": true,
                "wrapLogMessage": true,
                "sortOrder": "Descending"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "al-list": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 1044,
          "title": "Demo alerts",
          "description": "Grafana-managed alerts in the demo folder (label ${demo_label}=true): gateway errors, latency, spend, guard denies and Bedrock health.",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "alertlist",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "viewMode": "list",
                "groupMode": "default",
                "maxItems": 30,
                "sortOrder": 1,
                "stateFilter": {
                  "firing": true,
                  "pending": true,
                  "normal": true,
                  "error": true,
                  "noData": true
                },
                "alertInstanceLabelFilter": "",
                "alertName": "",
                "dashboardAlerts": false,
                "showInstances": true,
                "grouping": [],
                "folder": {
                  "uid": "${folder_uid}"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ab-text": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 1045,
          "title": "",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "### Everything observable from the Claude apps gateway alone\n| Signal | Where | In this dashboard |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Audit events** (JSON lines on the container output): `device.authorize`, `device.verify`, `session.mint`, `session.refresh`, `managed.serve`, `config.load`, `inference` (email, model, path, status, ms, upstream, client_ip) | Loki | Audit log tab |\n| **Spend ledger** per developer and period, spend caps, admin audit | Gateway Postgres over PDC | Spend store tab |\n| **Operational lines** (warn/info) and the other agent host containers | Loki | Operational logs tab |\n| **Derived series** for alerting | Grafana recording rules, no exporter | Derived metrics tab |\n| **Its own Prometheus metrics or traces** | none: the gateway exposes neither | n/a |\n| **Client OTel** (Claude Code metrics, logs, traces) | forwarded by the gateway (`telemetry.forward_to`) but emitted by the client | not here: see *Observing Claude Code* |\n\nWhat the gateway cannot see: tool calls, MCP calls, file edits, anything inside the session. It sees who signed in, which policy they got, each model call and its cost."
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
